	(text "DNP by default: the bus is pulled up\nby the device-side 10k resistors on each\npanel and on the Mainboard\n\nFit a channel's pair only if, with that\npanel powered and its mux channel\nselected, SDA/SCL at the panel connector\nshow a high level < 2.3 V or a rise\ntime > 1 us (100 kHz)."
